WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  components/ai/AIVehiclePaintPreview.tsx — the optional Helix paint-preview proposal for the vehicle detail page, an
  opt-in card layered BENEATH the deterministic vehicle configuration. It never replaces the manual per-vehicle Color
  setting: Helix drafts a propose-only image prompt; the user keeps full control of the actual paint.

    export const AIVehiclePaintPreview = withAiFeature('vehicle-paint-preview', InnerSection)
      withAiFeature (components/ai/withAiFeature.tsx): returns null unless useAiEnabled('vehicle-paint-preview') is on
        (ADR-015). On = renders InnerSection inside a div carrying data-ai-feature="vehicle-paint-preview".
      InnerSection({ vehicleId?: number, styleHint?: string }):
        numericVehicleId = (typeof vehicleId==='number' && isFinite(vehicleId)) ? vehicleId : 0
        body  = styleHint?.trim() ? { style_hint: styleHint.trim() } : {}
        url   = numericVehicleId>0 ? `/ai/vehicles/${numericVehicleId}/paint-preview/draft`
                                   : '/ai/vehicles/0/paint-preview/draft'
        stream = useAiStream({ url, body, onEvent: () => {} })   // POST SSE; vehicleID in URL, style_hint in body
        haveInputs = numericVehicleId > 0
        renders <AIFeatureCard title="Draft a Helix paint preview" description=<privacy blurb>
                 buttonLabel="Preview paint color" badgeLabel="Helix"
                 emptyHint={haveInputs ? undefined : "Open a vehicle detail page to enable Helix."}
                 canStart={haveInputs} stream={stream}/>
  components/ai/AIFeatureCard.tsx — GlassPanel → header (title + AIBadge "Helix" + description + optional emptyHint
    when !canStart) → action Button → AiOutputPanel. The visible CTA label is the brand-constant "Ask Helix" (idle) /
    "Helix is thinking…" + AIThinkingDots (streaming); aria-label = "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}". disabled =
    !canStart || isStreaming.
  hooks/useAiStream.ts — AiStreamState = idle | streaming | paused-confirm | done | error. The drafting flow drives
    idle → streaming → done|error (its onEvent is a no-op; delta frames accumulate into stream.text). start() sets
    state='streaming'+text=''; 'delta' appends; 'done' settles; non-2xx start → 'stream_http_{status}' error;
    AbortError → back to idle.
  components/ai/AiOutputPanel.tsx — hidden when idle & text empty; AIThinkingIndicator (shimmer lines + "Helix is
    thinking" + dots) while streaming & text empty; whitespace-pre-wrap prose otherwise; "Helix error: {msg}" on error.
  i18n keys: vehicles.aiPaintPreview.title/description/button/badge/noVehicleHint + the shared helix.askHelix /
    helix.thinking / helix.errorLabel + ai.common.errorUnknown.

