STATES (every non-gated one renders — no hidden surface)
  gated    → withAiFeature off → the whole surface is withdrawn (EmptyView), reproducing the web null.
  loading  → skeleton header + description + CTA bars while the gate/context resolves (P4 leaf).
  empty    → the ready card with description + (when no vehicle id) the disabled CTA + the no-vehicle hint, and the
             output panel's friendly idle hint (web hides the panel when idle; the native leaf shows a paintpalette +
             hint so the region is never blank).
  error    → retryable context-error chrome (P4 leaf; the web vehicle page renders its deterministic configuration).
  stream   → idle (friendly hint) / streaming (thinking → prose) / done (prose) / failed ("Helix error: {msg}").
  stale    → header chip + banner + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → header chip + banner over last-known context; no auto-refresh (manual refresh button available).

